      "text": [
        "1495 - وَقَالَ أَمِيرُ اَلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «اَلسَّحَابُ غِرْبَالُ اَلْمَطَرِ لَوْ لاَ ذَلِكَ لَأَفْسَدَ كُلَّ شَيْءٍ وَقَعَ عَلَيْهِ»."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1495 - The Commander of the Faithful Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) said:\n\"The clouds are the sieve of the rain; without that, it would ruin everything it falls upon”."
        ]
      }
